{
    desc => ':set nonu is abbreviation for :set nonumber',
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/set_nonumber_abbrev`

Tests that `:set nonu` is accepted as an abbreviation for `:set nonumber`
and hides the line number gutter.

Ex: `:set number` then `:set nonu`

- **set_nonumber_abbrev_with_numbers.png**: Line numbers visible in the left gutter.
- **set_nonumber_abbrev_after_nonu.png**: Line numbers hidden; gutter area collapsed.
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->ex('set number');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('with_numbers');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->ex('set nonu');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_nonu');
    },
}
